1. Definitions

"Software" means Liber Animalium in each form: the compiled files, the code, the data files, and
each other file that the copyright holder supplies with it.

"Official source" means a download page that the copyright holder operates or approves.


2. Ownership

The Software is licensed, not sold. The copyright holder keeps each right that this license does not
give to you in clear words.


3. What you can do

You can:

a) download the Software from an official source;
b) install the unchanged Software and run it, in a single-player game and on a server;
c) list the Software in a modpack, if the launcher downloads the Software from an official source
   and the modpack file does not contain the Software;
d) show the Software in videos, streams and pictures;
e) make a mod that uses the Software as a dependency, and distribute that mod, if the mod obeys
   section 4.


4. Conditions for a mod that uses the Software as a dependency

a) Your mod must not contain the Software or a part of it.
b) The users of your mod must get the Software from an official source.
c) Your mod must not change, replace or patch the code of the Software.
d) You must not say or suggest that the copyright holder made your mod or approves it.

This license gives you no right in the Software itself. Your mod stays your work.


5. What you must not do

Unless section 3 permits it, or the law gives you a right that a license cannot remove, you must not:

a) copy, publish, upload, mirror, sell, rent, lend or sublicense the Software or a part of it;
b) modify, translate or adapt the Software, or make a work that is derived from it;
c) decompile, disassemble or reverse engineer the Software, or try to get its source code;
d) remove, disable or go around a technical measure that protects the Software or its files;
e) take the code, the data files or other content out of the Software, or use them in a different
   work;
f) remove or change a copyright notice or this license;
g) say that you made the Software.


6. End of the license

This license ends automatically when you do not obey it. When it ends, you must stop all use of the
Software and delete each copy that you have.


